Performance Manager generic Rill Runtime
========================================

The full All-in-One package redistributes the exact `/usr/bin/rill-runtime`
payload built from the qualified `rill-runtime` recipe in
`hello-yunshu/rill-openwrt-packages`. Runtime source ownership, MIT license and
transitive dependency notices remain with that repository and its upstream
RillML release. This repository records the immutable source and qualification
identity in `contracts/rill-runtime.json`; it does not vendor Runtime source or
build a private adapter.

The split `performance-manager-rill` package continues to consume the same
external package independently. In both forms Runtime only ranks/reports;
Performance Manager Core validates and executes actions.

Historical adapter snapshots, where retained under `contracts/upstream/` or
`docs/history/`, are audit fixtures only and are not active package payloads.
